avigation</div></div>\n\t<div class=\"sa-nav-grid\">\n\t\t<div class=\"sa-nav-card home\"><div class=\"sa-nav-icon\"><br></div><h3>Home</h3><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboards-928\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Home&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>00 - Home / Introductory</p></div></div><div class=\"sa-nav-card executive\"><div class=\"sa-nav-icon\"><br></div><h3>Executive</h3><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-152,dashboards-929\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Exec CC&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>10 - Executive Command Center</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-152,dashboards-930\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Platform Value&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>11 - Platform Value Overview</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-152,dashboards-931\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Env Health Exec&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>12 - Environment Health Executive</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-152,dashboards-932\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Availability&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>13 - Availability and Service Health</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-152,dashboards-933\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Capacity Risk&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>14 - Capacity and Risk Overview</p></div></div><div class=\"sa-nav-card operational\"><div class=\"sa-nav-icon\"><br></div><h3>Operational</h3><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-153,dashboards-934\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Ops CC&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>20 - Operational Command Center</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-153,dashboards-935\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Active Alerts&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>21 - Active Alerts</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-153,dashboards-936\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Resource Health&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>22 - Resource Health</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-153,dashboards-937\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Websites&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><p>23 - Websites and Services</p></div><div class=\"sa-nav-item\"><a href=\"https://proservices.logicmonitor.com/santaba/uiv4/dashboards/dashboardGroups-151,dashboardGroups-153,dashboards-938\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#93c5fd; text-decorati